the spectre of renegotiation pushed enron shares down more than 5 % , or us 27 cents , to us $ 4 . 74 at the close of friday trading on the new york stock exchange . dynegy shares closed up us 64 cents , or 1 . 61 % , to us $ 40 . 40 .
