"ews united way leadership reception last year , enron employees generously donated a record $ 2 . 8 million to the united way , an amount which exceeded our goal of $ 2 . 3 million by nearly half a million dollars . this year we are setting our sights even higher with a goal of $ 2 . 9 million . when matched dollar for dollar by enron , our total contribution would be $ 5 . 8 million .
